<title>POLAND: DEBICA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 5.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 5.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.50 vs   3.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.97 vs   3.80</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.78 vs   4.67</p>
<p> Sales		   51.00 vs  38.64</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Firma Oponiarska</p>
<p>Debica SA.</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.27 vs   5.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	19.01 vs   7.80</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.08 vs   9.90</p>
<p> Sales		  105.07 vs  80.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
